WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.140
Can you go to my calendar and find me a half an hour tomorrow so I can mail some of these cookies to my grandson?

00:06.580 --> 00:08.280
I've added a post office trip at 10.

00:08.480 --> 00:09.420
All right, SGA, we're ready.

00:09.660 --> 00:11.360
Chachi-Pete-Boys!

00:12.300 --> 00:15.400
Chachi-Pete-Boys got a whole lot more useful.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.940
It's no longer just answering questions.

00:18.200 --> 00:20.540
It's better at getting things done.

00:21.200 --> 00:24.400
Talk to me, honey.

00:24.560 --> 00:25.740
Let me show you an example.

00:25.740 --> 00:29.600
Can you go into my finances and let me know if you see any duplicate charges?

00:30.000 --> 00:31.300
Sure, checking your accounts.

00:31.660 --> 00:35.580
Okay, it looks like you're paying twice for a magazine called Sound and Stereo.

00:35.720 --> 00:36.600
Well, that's odd.

00:36.760 --> 00:40.380
Can you cancel the duplicate and send an email asking for a refund?

00:40.640 --> 00:41.000
Of course.

00:42.120 --> 00:44.620
Can you make me a website where I can sell my pottery?

00:45.000 --> 00:45.480
Absolutely.

00:45.980 --> 00:46.660
I'll start building.

00:47.740 --> 00:48.940
This looks good.

00:49.260 --> 00:51.380
Can you add just a simple checkout page?

00:51.500 --> 00:52.480
Yep, adding now.

00:52.860 --> 00:57.780
Can you send an email to the Fairfield Marina requesting a sailboat rental for this afternoon?

00:58.080 --> 00:58.500
Sure thing.

00:58.700 --> 00:59.320
I'll send that email.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.480
What time is my appointment at the salon?

01:02.880 --> 01:04.800
Checking now in 10 minutes.

01:05.080 --> 01:06.020
Oh, gotta go.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.400
Did the Marina boat rental email me back yet?

01:09.620 --> 01:11.920
Yep, they have a sailboat available at 4 p.m.

01:11.920 --> 01:12.780
Great, book it.

01:13.560 --> 01:14.400
All right, sure.

01:15.380 --> 01:18.420
Can you check if I got any orders on my pottery website?

01:18.800 --> 01:20.600
It doesn't look like you've gotten any orders.

01:20.660 --> 01:21.080
Darn.

01:21.440 --> 01:23.340
Can you go to my friend Lavelle's website?

01:23.340 --> 01:27.900
I think she emailed me the link and I want to buy a cookie jar.

01:27.900 --> 01:31.780
Can you check the weather at the Fairfield Marina?

01:31.780 --> 01:35.420
Winds are around 8 knots out of the west with gusts up to 12.

01:35.420 --> 01:36.760
Like you know how to sail.

01:36.760 --> 01:38.380
Of course I know how to sail.

01:38.380 --> 01:38.880
Yeah, right.

01:38.880 --> 01:40.960
I feel like we're in a pharma commercial.

01:43.960 --> 01:46.660
Say something nice to me.

01:47.540 --> 01:52.640
As you can see, you can now use chat GPT voice to get things done on the go.

01:52.720 --> 01:53.780
Guys, I think we got it.

01:53.780 --> 01:55.160
Thank God.

01:55.700 --> 01:57.280
Now how do you sail a boat?

01:58.020 --> 02:00.900
Say something nice to me.

02:00.900 --> 02:01.740
Oh, great question.
